{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57571","headline":"东方歌 · 无名氏","name":"东方歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东方有木本名砂，爲男爲女亦爲芽。\n受气午成须立子，含精育质长金家。\n自从成长多年月，朝朝各自向天涯。\n莫欺形貌黑皴皵，浑身緫是日精华。\n忽若遇着阴家子，不假良媒自相许。\n迎归宝帐到中宫，阴阳气合情意与。\n特地爲胎重造化，运动坎离巡八卦。\n十月怀胎母子分，定知霄汉骖鸾驾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}